<li>&lt;a href="William%20Wallace%20Lincoln"&gt;William Wallace "Willie" Lincoln&lt;/a&gt; (gumelar 1850), pupus alatan panas tiris di &lt;a href="Gedong%20Bodas"&gt;Gedong Bodas&lt;/a&gt; dina 20 Pébruari 1862.</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Tad%20Lincoln"&gt;Thomas "Tad" Lincoln&lt;/a&gt; (gumelar 1853), pupus dina yuswa 18 taun alatan &lt;a href="%C3%A9d%C3%A9ma"&gt;édéma&lt;/a&gt;.</<li>
