<li>Miller, Zachary A. "False Idol: The Memory of Andrew Johnson and Reconstruction in Greeneville, Tennessee 1869–2022" (Tésis MA, East Tennessee State University, 2022).</li>
<li>O'Brien, John J., III. "The Mechanic Statesman and the Military Chieftain: Andrew Johnson, William B. Campbell and the Meaning of Liberty and Union in Antebellum Tennessee" (Tésis PhD, Saint Louis University, 2017).</li>
<li>Wedge, Lucius. "Andrew Johnson and the ministers of Nashville: A study in the relationship between war, politics, and morality" (Tésis PhD, University of Akron, 2013).</li>
